sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant TM as Python Script (TokenManager)
    participant CF as .questrade_cache
    participant KC as macOS Keychain
    participant Q as Questrade API

    Note over TM, CF: Start Data Fetch Cycle
    
    TM->>CF: Read encrypted binary data
    alt File Missing/Corrupt
        CF-->>TM: Error/None
        Note right of TM: Trigger UI Fallback (Relogin)
    else Data Loaded
        CF-->>TM: Ciphertext + Nonce
    end

    TM->>KC: keyring.get_password("InvestmentToolkit", "QuestradeMasterKey")
    KC-->>TM: Return Master Key
    
    Note over TM: AES-256-GCM Decryption (Verified)
    TM->>TM: Decrypt JSON Payload
    
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note right of TM: Success: Valid Token Available
    TM->>Q: Authorize Request with access_token
    Q-->>TM: Portfolio Metadata / Holdings
    end
